asr-000321
00:32:42.980 --> 00:32:53.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But for 2027, there is an increase, a significant increase in the budget to 4.04 billion, which is 1.4.

asr-000322
00:32:54.880 --> 00:32:59.700
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But for 2027, there is an increase, a significant increase in the budget to 2.145 billion more from the level of last year.

asr-000323
00:33:02.440 --> 00:33:08.260
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Our budget utilization rates for 2024 and 2025 are 100%.

asr-000324
00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:15.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And as of June of this year, we are at 38.46%.

asr-000325
00:33:15.060 --> 00:33:28.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ito po yung proposed versus allocated budget ng House of Representatives ay ng aming Civil Service Commission.

asr-000326
00:33:28.780 --> 00:33:58.760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Noong 2024, humingi po kami ng 3.06 billion. Ang naibigay po sa amin sa GAA ay 2.36 billion. Noong 2025, humingi po kami ng 4.12 billion. Ang na-allocate po sa amin ay 2.78 billion. Sa 2026, ang hinihingi po namin ay 5.9 billion. Ang binigay sa amin sa GAA ay 2.89 billion.

asr-000327
00:33:58.760 --> 00:33:58.780
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: [unclear]

asr-000328
00:33:58.780 --> 00:34:30.240
