asr-000331
00:35:00.220 --> 00:35:32.820
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and the PCSMP again. ICT requirements are those that support office productivity, sustain critical ICT operations and services, and advance the Commission's digital transformation initiatives such as internet connectivity and software subscription. So, another slide. Ayan po yung aming breakdown ng aming budget per allocation per allotment

asr-000332
00:35:32.820 --> 00:36:02.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: class. Uulitin ko po, personal services account for 1.8 billion or 46.6 percent, MOOE is 1.23 billion or 30.65 percent, while capital outlay is 911 million or 22.75 percent. Again, the increase in personal services is primarily due to the fourth tranche of the updated salary schedule. Thank you very much. The increases in MOOE and capital outlay are

asr-000333
00:36:02.800 --> 00:36:32.780
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: for inflationary adjustments, ICT requirements, and PCSMP requirements. The next chart shows our budget, the proposed budget, by object of expenditure. Ang aming significant increase, as you can see, is in the foreign-assisted projects. From P333 million in 2026, umabot po siya ng P1.453 billion in 2027. Operations and general administrative and support

asr-000334
00:36:32.780 --> 00:37:04.230
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: also increased while support operations is lower. I will again reiterate reasons for increase in GAS. The 56.354 million in GAS mainly reflects the fiscal year 2027 salary adjustment under the fourth tranche of the updated salary schedule.

asr-000335
00:37:04.230 --> 00:37:34.210
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Support operations, bumaba po ito sa operations, 36.6 million increase due to inflationary adjustments of MOOE. Locally funded project from 0.774 million increase in LFP or local funded projects is also inflationary pressures. For foreign-assisted projects, because of the focus on the Philippine Civil Service Modernization Program.

asr-000336
00:37:34.210 --> 00:38:04.190
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So ulit po, in summary, in 2026, 4.18 ang hiningi natin. Ang binigay sa atin ay 2.89. Ngayon po, nadagdagan siya ng 1.145 billion attributable to; meron tayong 1.14 billion sa general subsidy, regular subsidy, at 1.45 billion

asr-000337
00:38:04.190 --> 00:38:05.190
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: attributable

asr-000338
00:38:05.190 --> 00:38:06.190
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: to the

asr-000339
00:38:06.190 --> 00:38:07.190
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: PCSMP.

asr-000340
00:38:07.190 --> 00:38:12.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We

asr-000341
00:38:12.580 --> 00:38:13.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: will now give you the

asr-000342
00:38:13.580 --> 00:38:14.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: highlights of

asr-000343
00:38:14.580 --> 00:38:15.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: our 2027 targets.

asr-000344
00:38:15.580 --> 00:38:16.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: For 2027,

asr-000345
00:38:16.580 --> 00:38:17.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: CSC

asr-000346
00:38:17.580 --> 00:38:24.820
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: CSC will pursue digital transformation targets. These are development, initial implementation

asr-000347
00:38:24.820 --> 00:38:33.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and testing, transition, and capability building commitments in digital education.

asr-000348
00:38:33.100 --> 00:38:39.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The prime ESG will complete its assessment of the human resource management of target

asr-000349
00:38:39.940 --> 00:38:49.360
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: agencies and complete their transition readiness for transition to the HRMIS plus PS system.

asr-000350
00:38:49.360 --> 00:38:59.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa HRMIS PS or Human Resource Management Information System plus Pre-Role System initiative, mag

asr-000351
00:38:59.060 --> 00:39:08.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: go-live na po kami at the earliest, the last quarter ng 2026, but full go-live and testing

asr-000352
00:39:08.940 --> 00:39:09.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and customization.

asr-000353
00:39:09.940 --> 00:39:20.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa digital capability development, we have to provide role-based digital training for

asr-000354
00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:26.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: CSC personnel, HRMO, system operators, maintainers, and support teams.

asr-000355
00:39:26.880 --> 00:39:28.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The point is simple.

asr-000356
00:39:28.460 --> 00:39:34.400
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The systems will only work if the people operating and maintaining them are prepared or digitally

asr-000357
00:39:34.400 --> 00:39:36.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: enabled.

asr-000358
00:39:36.280 --> 00:39:38.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And we also aim to establish an integrated system.

asr-000359
00:39:38.940 --> 00:39:39.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Thank you.

asr-000360
00:39:39.940 --> 00:39:40.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Thank you.

asr-000361
00:39:40.940 --> 00:39:41.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Thank you for your questions.

asr-000362
00:39:41.940 --> 00:39:42.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, first of all, we need to understand this system of identity, where it is located within

asr-000363
00:39:42.940 --> 00:39:43.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: the system.

asr-000364
00:39:43.940 --> 00:39:44.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Secondly, we need to understand what is the local economy, where is the local social

asr-000365
00:39:44.940 --> 00:39:45.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: system, so that it is a completely integrated electronic administrative system, so that

asr-000366
00:39:45.940 --> 00:39:51.660
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: it will cover procurement, accounting, inventory, asset monitoring and management, to strengthen

asr-000367
00:39:51.660 --> 00:39:57.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: internal processing, transparency, and audit readiness.

asr-000368
00:39:57.940 --> 00:40:04.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: For professionalization and workplace cooperation, we are also in the process of developing a

asr-000369
00:40:04.300 --> 00:40:06.040
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: national learning management system.

asr-000370
00:40:06.040 --> 00:40:06.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The minimum target for 2027 is the national digital learning management system.

asr-000371
00:40:06.900 --> 00:40:07.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We need to understand how these processes are going to affect the quality of the local

asr-000372
00:40:07.900 --> 00:40:08.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: economy, especially in rural areas.

asr-000373
00:40:08.840 --> 00:40:09.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Next slide.

asr-000374
00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:17.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: is to migrate at least 20 existing CSC e-learning courses into an operational national learning platform

asr-000375
00:40:17.580 --> 00:40:24.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: to enable accessible, personalized, and scalable learning across the civil service.

asr-000376
00:40:24.700 --> 00:40:33.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We hope also to develop a secure, continuous online registration, examination, and eligibility certification system.

asr-000377
00:40:33.460 --> 00:40:38.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang ibig lang pong sabihin, ang aming vision dito ay magiging end-to-end ang system,

asr-000378
00:40:38.540 --> 00:40:45.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: mag-register online sa pag-exam, ang mag-exam yung applicant,

asr-000379
00:40:45.540 --> 00:40:52.320
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and then ma-compute ang kanilang grades, ma-issue ang kanilang whether they passed or not,

asr-000380
00:40:52.540 --> 00:40:57.560
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and issue the certificate eligibility through one seamless process end-to-end.

asr-000381
00:40:58.260 --> 00:40:58.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Okay.

asr-000382
00:40:59.260 --> 00:41:05.040
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: As to the accreditation and registration of public sector employees organization,

asr-000383
00:41:05.040 --> 00:41:08.520
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: we also want to develop and accredit.

asr-000384
00:41:08.540 --> 00:41:11.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We want to develop an accreditation and registration electronic system

asr-000385
00:41:11.540 --> 00:41:16.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para mas madali ang mag-apply for registration and accreditation.

asr-000386
00:41:17.440 --> 00:41:24.380
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We are also intending to install a special eligibility through special law system.

asr-000387
00:41:24.760 --> 00:41:32.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ibig sabihin, online na rin at digital ang ating pag-process ng applications at issuance ng special eligibilities

asr-000388
00:41:32.880 --> 00:41:37.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: that are gained through special laws and issuances.

asr-000389
00:41:38.540 --> 00:41:49.920
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa administrative justice system, ito po ang pinakamalaking pangarap namin kasi mabagal po ang ating paper-based na administrative justice system.

asr-000390
00:41:50.420 --> 00:41:57.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The CSC Legal and Administrative Services System is a digital platform designed to modernize and streamline

asr-000391
00:41:57.800 --> 00:42:01.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: the Civil Service Commission's legal and administrative service processes,

asr-000392
00:42:01.860 --> 00:42:08.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: which means that there will be key services including electronic filing and service of

asr-000393
00:42:08.340 --> 00:42:14.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: pleadings, motions, and other submissions for greater convenience and accessibility to clients nationwide.

asr-000394
00:42:15.640 --> 00:42:22.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: There will be also electronic processing of CSC clearances para hindi na lang paper, document,

asr-000395
00:42:22.140 --> 00:42:26.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na papunta-punta pa balik-balik sa field offices at saka sa central office.

asr-000396
00:42:27.040 --> 00:42:37.040
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We will also include an online payment of applicable fees and charges and paperless transactions and real-time case status monitoring.

asr-000397
00:42:39.780 --> 00:42:47.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: This is more or less an overall comprehensive overview of our targets for 2027.

asr-000398
00:42:48.460 --> 00:42:55.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kahit marami po ang aming request for 2027, meron pa rin po kami yung mga unfunded proposals,

asr-000399
00:42:55.200 --> 00:43:00.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: our wish list, so-called, kasi kapag nangailangan din po ito ng Civil Service Commission.

asr-000400
00:43:00.340 --> 00:43:07.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang nangunguna po dito ay ang mga infrastructure projects ng ating mga regional and field offices.

asr-000401
00:43:07.900 --> 00:43:09.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pangpumapangalawa po dito ay operations.

asr-000402
00:43:09.780 --> 00:43:20.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Siyang subyak rin ang mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga mga.

asr-000403
00:43:20.460 --> 00:43:25.360
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Uh, karamihan na age ng aming mga vehicles are seven to nine years.

asr-000404
00:43:26.060 --> 00:43:31.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, ready na po kami for, for, uh, refleeting.

asr-000405
00:43:31.760 --> 00:43:35.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then the last one is, um, green energy.

asr-000406
00:43:35.940 --> 00:43:39.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang puntu lang po nito ay kailangan na po nating para...

asr-000407
00:43:39.780 --> 00:43:47.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: mabawasan ang ating utilities, electric utilities budget, at para rin makasiguro po tayo na

asr-000408
00:43:47.840 --> 00:43:54.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: merong backup energy sources dahil ang PCSMP, pag mag-digital transformation pa tayo, parami

asr-000409
00:43:54.740 --> 00:44:00.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: po tayong online or electronic na systems, kailangan po ng mga backup na energy sources

asr-000410
00:44:00.600 --> 00:44:06.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para kahit mag-brown out ay meron po tayong, hindi po madi-disrupt ang ating mga systems.

asr-000411
00:44:06.440 --> 00:44:14.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: All right. Just briefly, ito po yung first priority. Ito po kasi yung listahan ng mga regional

