asr-000414
00:44:27.260 --> 00:44:32.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: po sila ng grant ng pera para maipatayo itong mga field offices na ito kasama na ang mga

asr-000415
00:44:32.900 --> 00:44:35.240
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: regional offices. Nakagaya rin po.

asr-000416
00:44:36.440 --> 00:44:46.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang pangalawa po ay yung pinatawag nating infrastructure improvement requirements.

asr-000417
00:44:46.620 --> 00:44:53.480
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Karamihan ay renovation and improvement of existing facilities such as records storage

asr-000418
00:44:53.480 --> 00:45:00.180
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and then dormitories, parking areas, and other operational facilities.

asr-000419
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:15.400
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang pinakahuli sa lahat ng infrastructure needs ay mga tinatawag na building refurbishment, repainting, waterworks, and other necessary facility enhancements in our regional and field offices.

asr-000420
00:45:15.400 --> 00:45:37.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa next slide po, ito yung mga requirements natin sa operational mobility. Isang car for BARM and then yung tatlong units ng minibus for the central office kasi ito yung ginagamit for shuttle at saka for transporting people when they go to trainings, workshops, and other activities.

asr-000421
00:45:37.800 --> 00:45:44.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And yung passenger van, tatlo ang para sa central office at apat sa selected na regional offices.

asr-000422
00:45:45.400 --> 00:45:59.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then the last one is the installation of a solar panel system and generator system. As I said earlier, ito ay green energy program.

asr-000423
00:45:59.020 --> 00:46:13.080
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The project will help reduce electricity costs, provide backup power for critical frontline and ICT services, and support the government's energy efficiency and green workplace policies.

asr-000424
