asr-000433
00:47:15.060 --> 00:47:19.060
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung oratorical at saka yung ating essay writing contest.

asr-000434
00:47:19.140 --> 00:47:25.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It is a means to encourage more young people to be informed about the Civil Service Commission.

asr-000435
00:47:25.460 --> 00:47:29.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: At ang kanilang topic po ay puso, dangal, at galing para sa bayan.

asr-000436
00:47:30.220 --> 00:47:37.660
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It will culminate in, well we hope it will happen in September, pero because of the weather it might be postponed again.

asr-000437
00:47:38.160 --> 00:47:47.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ito po ay ang gawad lingkod bayani, which recognizes as outstanding achievements both in the regional levels and in the national level,

asr-000438
00:47:47.500 --> 00:47:48.760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: which will be the gawad.

asr-000439
00:47:49.140 --> 00:48:06.480
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang lahat po ng aming mga programa ay pagsusulong ng aming layunin na gawing lingkod bayani ang bawat kawani na may puso, dangal, at galing para sa bayan.

asr-000440
00:48:07.020 --> 00:48:09.820
