Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: in an alternating manner when practicable.

asr-000459
00:50:33.040 --> 00:50:34.780
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The Chair first recognize...

asr-000460
00:50:35.040 --> 00:50:43.320
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The Honorable Praminority Representative, my boss, Robert Nazal.

asr-000461
00:50:43.320 --> 00:50:48.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you to Mr. Chair.

asr-000462
00:50:48.640 --> 00:50:52.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you to my idol, Congressman Bong.

asr-000463
00:50:54.700 --> 00:51:02.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chair, through the Chair, Madam Secretary,

asr-000464
00:51:02.740 --> 00:51:02.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Secretary,

asr-000465
00:51:02.820 --> 00:51:10.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: we have held several budget hearings, and we are bringing up the seven-day parental leave

asr-000466
00:51:10.180 --> 00:51:15.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: for qualified J.O. and C.O.S. solo parents.

asr-000467
00:51:17.240 --> 00:51:24.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Republic 11861 and its IRR have been in place since 2022.

asr-000468
00:51:24.100 --> 00:51:32.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Last year, Mr. Chair, CSC told us it would discuss this with DBM,

asr-000469
00:51:32.820 --> 00:51:43.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: but in 2025, the CSC, COA, and DBM already issued a joint circular,

asr-000470
00:51:44.080 --> 00:51:49.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: specifically governing J.O., your job order at Contract of Service Workers,

asr-000471
00:51:50.420 --> 00:51:52.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: about providing ancillary benefits.

asr-000472
00:51:53.540 --> 00:51:55.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, you already talked, ma'am.

asr-000473
00:51:56.700 --> 00:52:00.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Why didn't you include the seven-day solo parent leave?

asr-000474
00:52:00.280 --> 00:52:01.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Um...

asr-000475
00:52:02.820 --> 00:52:08.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It's already in the Joint Memorandum Circular, a specific provision of it.

asr-000476
00:52:08.620 --> 00:52:18.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Section 11.2 states that all benefits are already granted in existing laws.

asr-000477
00:52:18.280 --> 00:52:20.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, it's included in the parental law.

asr-000478
00:52:20.140 --> 00:52:22.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, you don't need to mention it anymore?

asr-000479
00:52:22.040 --> 00:52:26.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Even if we don't need to mention it anymore, but as a policy in the Civil Service,

asr-000480
00:52:26.620 --> 00:52:31.240
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: we interpret the Solo Parent Welfare Act as...

asr-000481
00:52:31.240 --> 00:52:32.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Um...

asr-000482
00:52:32.120 --> 00:52:32.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: As...

asr-000483
00:52:32.740 --> 00:52:38.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: As being able to grant yung seven-day wellness leave to solo parents,

asr-000484
00:52:38.080 --> 00:52:40.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: whether they be male or female.

asr-000485
00:52:41.420 --> 00:52:43.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May seven-day wellness leave sila.

asr-000486
00:52:43.340 --> 00:52:48.700
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nag-hukay po kami sa archives namin, kasi darawang taon pa lang po ako sa komisyon.

asr-000487
00:52:49.160 --> 00:52:52.120
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Meron na pala kaming na-issue na circular in 2004,

asr-000488
00:52:52.580 --> 00:52:57.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: allowing parenta a solo parent leave of seven days.

asr-000489
00:52:57.180 --> 00:52:58.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Has this been...

asr-000490
00:52:59.120 --> 00:53:02.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chair, has this been communicated already?

asr-000491
00:53:02.240 --> 00:53:02.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I think...

asr-000492
00:53:02.580 --> 00:53:03.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: To the Depart...

asr-000493
00:53:03.300 --> 00:53:05.260
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Na-circularize na po yan sa lahat ng Departamento.

asr-000494
00:53:05.260 --> 00:53:05.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ano po?

asr-000495
00:53:05.740 --> 00:53:07.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Alam na po ng mga Departamento yan?

asr-000496
00:53:07.280 --> 00:53:08.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Alam na po nila.

asr-000497
00:53:08.360 --> 00:53:08.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I mean...

asr-000498
00:53:08.920 --> 00:53:09.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Naa-apply na po ba?

asr-000499
00:53:10.300 --> 00:53:16.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Meron lang po akong a little bit of caution, kasi sa Solo Parents Welfare Act,

asr-000500
00:53:16.860 --> 00:53:21.780
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ang principal na implementing authority ay ang DSWD.

asr-000501
00:53:23.040 --> 00:53:30.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, meron po kaming ongoing ngayon na mga dialogues para kung pwede ay ilabas na nila,

asr-000502
00:53:31.100 --> 00:53:31.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: because they are the...

asr-000503
00:53:32.580 --> 00:53:36.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The Primary Implementing Agency for the Solo Parents Welfare Act.

asr-000504
00:53:36.540 --> 00:53:42.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Para i-clarify na po nila itong already recognized by the Civil Service Commission,

asr-000505
00:53:42.900 --> 00:53:50.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ang seven-day parental leave for solo parents ay available na po as early as 2004 from our end.

asr-000506
00:53:50.380 --> 00:53:51.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Siguro nga po...

asr-000507
00:53:51.060 --> 00:54:01.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But we also recognize para ma-implement yung batas at saka kaayon din yung joint circular namin ng DBM

asr-000508
00:54:01.540 --> 00:54:03.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka ng COA.

asr-000509
00:54:05.490 --> 00:54:10.630
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: If necessary, if it is still necessary, but which I think is already, baka hindi na,

asr-000510
00:54:11.250 --> 00:54:21.030
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: pero pwede naman kaming mag-issue ng reiterative issuance and application of the seven-day wellness leave for solo parents.

asr-000511
00:54:21.130 --> 00:54:30.430
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Baka po mas maganda, kasi I think there are still a lot of departments who are in fear of implementing the law.

asr-000512
00:54:30.730 --> 00:54:31.050
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Opo.

asr-000513
00:54:31.050 --> 00:54:32.970
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi po, natatakot sila.

asr-000514
00:54:33.010 --> 00:54:35.990
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sa audit or disallowance, yung mga ganon.

asr-000515
00:54:36.430 --> 00:54:39.370
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, mas mabuti na po sigurong i-reiterate natin.

asr-000516
00:54:39.390 --> 00:54:39.630
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Opo.

asr-000517
00:54:40.010 --> 00:54:45.210
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Although, palagi po namin ginagamit nga yung particular section na yon ng Joint Memorandum Circular

asr-000518
00:54:45.210 --> 00:54:52.070
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: kasi kasali na po doon ang DBM, which has jurisdiction over JOs and COs, at kasama na rin po ang COA.

asr-000519
00:54:52.410 --> 00:54:55.970
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, yung mga audit concerns natin ay na-address na rin po.

asr-000520
00:54:57.530 --> 00:55:02.970
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Perhaps it can be reiterated, itong particular section ito ng Joint Memorandum.

asr-000521
00:55:03.010 --> 00:55:05.890
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sige po, para lang po malaman din natin.

asr-000522
00:55:05.990 --> 00:55:09.250
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi marami pa pong departments ang siguro hindi pa rin na-implement.

asr-000523
00:55:09.430 --> 00:55:11.890
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo. Salamat. Opo. We will do that. Opo.

asr-000524
00:55:12.690 --> 00:55:27.050
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam, Mr. Chair, through the Chair, what is CSC completely doing about the large number of unfilled plantilla positions across government

asr-000525
00:55:27.050 --> 00:55:31.810
Rep. Roberto Nazal: while we continue to rely heavily on JO and COS workers?

asr-000526
00:55:33.010 --> 00:55:34.090
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sandali lang po, ma'am.

asr-000527
00:55:34.790 --> 00:55:44.330
Rep. Roberto Nazal: CSC's own inventory already accounts 919,868 JO and COS workers.

asr-000528
00:55:44.330 --> 00:55:54.590
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What is CSC's government-wide plan to match qualified JOCOS workers with vacant plantilla positions,

asr-000529
00:55:55.250 --> 00:55:58.530
Rep. Roberto Nazal: help those who lack eligibility obtain it,

asr-000530
00:55:59.270 --> 00:56:02.330
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and reduce both vacancies and...

asr-000531
00:56:03.010 --> 00:56:04.930
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ...independence on contractual arrangements?

asr-000532
00:56:05.850 --> 00:56:11.670
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you please give us measurable targets and a timeline, not just programs?

asr-000533
00:56:12.590 --> 00:56:22.170
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I am reluctant to give targets kasi parang ito yung absorption ng JOs and COs into the civil service.

asr-000534
00:56:22.570 --> 00:56:26.670
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi po, ang appointing authority po ay hindi po kami, unang-una.

asr-000535
00:56:27.670 --> 00:56:31.990
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pangalawa po, kaya hindi mo pwedeng isigurado,

asr-000536
00:56:31.990 --> 00:56:38.790
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: kasi dapat yung JO at CO, yung kanyang qualifications, ay fit dun sa vacant na posisyon.

asr-000537
00:56:39.250 --> 00:56:44.950
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kadalasan po yung mga nag-a-apply, hindi fit yung qualifications nila sa ina-applyan na posisyon.

asr-000538
00:56:45.350 --> 00:56:57.710
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: However, I think yung pinaka-ano namin na program so far is the grant of preferential rating for JOs and COs.

asr-000539
00:56:57.710 --> 00:57:00.710
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang ibig sabihin, mag-exam sila.

asr-000540
00:57:01.990 --> 00:57:07.250
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then, huwag lang bababa sa 70% ang kanilang grade, ang kanilang score.

asr-000541
00:57:08.210 --> 00:57:11.170
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Magdadagdaga ng 10% para makapasa po sila.

asr-000542
00:57:12.250 --> 00:57:16.810
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, mas maluwag na po yung avenue to enter government service.

asr-000543
00:57:17.190 --> 00:57:20.370
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But their passing of the civil service eligibility exam,

asr-000544
00:57:21.090 --> 00:57:26.910
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: kailangan pa rin po nilang mag-comply sa other qualification requirements such as experience,

asr-000545
00:57:26.910 --> 00:57:31.910
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: training, educational qualifications.

asr-000546
00:57:31.990 --> 00:57:38.210
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero ang idinagdag namin para mas mapaluwag ang daanan ng JOs at COs,

asr-000547
00:57:38.210 --> 00:57:45.090
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: dati 10 years experience ang hinihingi namin sa kanila bago sila makapag-apply sa CS preferential rating.

asr-000548
00:57:45.450 --> 00:57:48.010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ngayon, hinati na po namin 5 years na lang.

asr-000549
00:57:49.790 --> 00:57:55.650
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, kung matagal na siya sa government service, yung kanyang experience requirement fulfilled na rin niya.

asr-000550
00:57:55.650 --> 00:58:00.970
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang problema na lang niya is yung training hours niya, training or competency hours niya,

asr-000551
00:58:00.970 --> 00:58:03.950
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka yung kanyang educational qualification.

asr-000552
00:58:04.490 --> 00:58:11.530
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But if they have educational qualifications fit for first level or second level,

asr-000553
00:58:11.650 --> 00:58:13.850
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: then they can get in the government service.

asr-000554
00:58:14.010 --> 00:58:16.090
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When did you implement this change?

asr-000555
00:58:17.110 --> 00:58:19.530
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Itong 5 years? Is it the 5 years?

asr-000556
00:58:19.550 --> 00:58:19.670
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-000557
00:58:20.550 --> 00:58:21.770
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Early this year.

asr-000558
00:58:21.930 --> 00:58:22.690
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Early this year.

asr-000559
00:58:22.750 --> 00:58:25.930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: After nung matapos ang budget deliberation.

asr-000560
00:58:26.330 --> 00:58:27.530
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, after the budget deliberation.

asr-000561
00:58:27.570 --> 00:58:29.370
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano po yung naging epekto niya?

asr-000562
00:58:29.850 --> 00:58:30.850
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan po ang na-fix?

asr-000563
00:58:30.970 --> 00:58:31.930
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano po yung na-fill na plantilya?

asr-000564
00:58:33.270 --> 00:58:38.930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mahirap pong i-monitor ng ganon yung ilan ang ma-fill na dahil pinaluwag.

asr-000565
00:58:39.270 --> 00:58:45.630
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero merong increase in the number of applicants and passers sa CSPR.

asr-000566
00:58:46.270 --> 00:58:49.770
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I cannot at this point in time, kasi wala akong datos na hawak,

asr-000567
00:58:50.210 --> 00:58:56.710
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: establish a direct correlation between those measures

asr-000568
00:58:56.710 --> 00:59:00.710
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and the absorption of JOs and COOs in the system.

asr-000569
00:59:00.970 --> 00:59:08.190
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The only thing I can say is we will keep working at making absorption in the civil service

asr-000570
00:59:08.190 --> 00:59:11.650
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: more efficient and more accessible.

asr-000571
00:59:12.490 --> 00:59:26.110
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, if we are talking about numbers, ilang percent po ang binaba or ang na-absorb sa plantilya from JOs and COOs?

asr-000572
00:59:26.110 --> 00:59:28.650
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi, di ba, matagal na yung problema to eh.

asr-000573
00:59:29.090 --> 00:59:30.530
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May mga JOs tayo.

asr-000574
00:59:30.970 --> 00:59:34.610
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May mga COOs na more than 10 years na hung nagtatrabaho.

asr-000575
00:59:34.750 --> 00:59:38.110
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May mga 15 years na na nagtatrabaho, JO pa rin.

asr-000576
00:59:38.790 --> 00:59:43.810
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano po bang, may pag-asa po po pa ho ba silang ma-plantilya?

asr-000577
00:59:44.690 --> 00:59:47.690
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya nga po, pag ma-fulfill po nila yung requirement.

asr-000578
00:59:48.890 --> 00:59:54.290
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi hindi po naman namin pwedeng tanggalin yung requirement ng educational achievement,

asr-000579
00:59:54.290 --> 01:00:00.010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yung experience, training, at saka appropriate civil service eligibility.

asr-000580
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: kasi nandito po sa EO 292

asr-000581
01:00:02.540 --> 01:00:04.420
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yun. Legislation po ito

asr-000582
01:00:04.420 --> 01:00:06.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at hindi po kami ang pwedeng magpalit

asr-000583
01:00:06.140 --> 01:00:08.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: niyan. Nandun na po tayo eh. Assuming

asr-000584
01:00:08.100 --> 01:00:09.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: sila, marami naman hong

asr-000585
01:00:09.760 --> 01:00:12.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pasado eh. Pero let's call

asr-000586
01:00:12.100 --> 01:00:14.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: a spade a spade. Minsan po o kadalasan

asr-000587
01:00:14.000 --> 01:00:15.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang nangyayari po talaga dito,

asr-000588
01:00:15.880 --> 01:00:17.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: palakasan o ayaw talagang punuin.

asr-000589
01:00:18.360 --> 01:00:19.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Diba? Ayaw punuin yung plantilya.

asr-000590
01:00:21.200 --> 01:00:21.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So,

asr-000591
01:00:21.720 --> 01:00:24.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: what will the CSC do

asr-000592
01:00:24.020 --> 01:00:25.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: concretely

asr-000593
01:00:25.360 --> 01:00:28.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: para po maiwasan na po

asr-000594
01:00:28.120 --> 01:00:28.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ito? Kasi

asr-000595
01:00:28.560 --> 01:00:32.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: all the departments, ganyan po ang issue natin.

asr-000596
01:00:32.760 --> 01:00:33.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang dami nung plantilya

asr-000597
01:00:33.880 --> 01:00:36.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: positions, pero hindi naman

asr-000598
01:00:36.020 --> 01:00:37.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: siya napupuno. Pero

asr-000599
01:00:37.820 --> 01:00:40.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: despite that, napakadami ng JOs

asr-000600
01:00:40.040 --> 01:00:41.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and COs. Hindi naman

asr-000601
01:00:41.840 --> 01:00:43.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pwede natin sabihin na walang qualified doon.

asr-000602
01:00:44.540 --> 01:00:45.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan taon na nagtatrabaho

asr-000603
01:00:45.880 --> 01:00:48.240
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: doon. I appreciate

asr-000604
01:00:48.240 --> 01:00:49.680
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yung concern po ninyo.

asr-000605
01:00:49.840 --> 01:00:51.420
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang concern ko po naman

asr-000606
01:00:51.420 --> 01:00:53.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ay wala pong datos to establish.

asr-000607
01:00:53.940 --> 01:00:54.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: A direct correlation

asr-000608
01:00:54.980 --> 01:00:58.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: between yung mga nakakakuha

asr-000609
01:00:58.440 --> 01:00:58.560
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ng

asr-000610
01:00:58.560 --> 01:00:59.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: CSPR

asr-000611
01:00:59.460 --> 01:01:02.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka yung absorption in the

asr-000612
01:01:02.280 --> 01:01:03.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: civil service.

asr-000613
01:01:04.500 --> 01:01:06.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Subukan po natin as a

asr-000614
01:01:06.100 --> 01:01:08.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: continuing concern, baka pag pumasok

asr-000615
01:01:08.540 --> 01:01:10.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na po yung system ng CSEVs,

asr-000616
01:01:10.300 --> 01:01:12.320
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ay ng data management system,

asr-000617
01:01:12.680 --> 01:01:14.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: baka may maghugot po tayo dito

asr-000618
01:01:14.340 --> 01:01:16.180
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na datos para maka-establish

asr-000619
01:01:16.180 --> 01:01:18.460
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ng correlation or prepare a program

asr-000620
01:01:18.460 --> 01:01:20.260
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: in terms of absorption.

asr-000621
01:01:21.100 --> 01:01:22.320
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: One thing really

asr-000622
01:01:22.320 --> 01:01:23.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: is we cannot guarantee

asr-000623
01:01:23.960 --> 01:01:26.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: employment in the civil service

asr-000624
01:01:27.040 --> 01:01:28.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: habang

asr-000625
01:01:28.440 --> 01:01:30.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: nandoon yung mga

asr-000626
01:01:30.100 --> 01:01:32.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: qualification requirements,

asr-000627
01:01:32.780 --> 01:01:34.200
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: habang may nirequire na

