CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, Congresswoman Ismula. Sa resolution po, meron pong provision on reporting and enforcement. It's letter D of the resolution. Nakalagay po dito, any official, employee, client, or concerned member of the public may report violations of this policy through the CSE Contact Center ng Bayan or other complaint referral system.

asr-000921
