CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Anong pagkakaiba sa eligibility ng elected councillors po?

asr-000951
01:19:25.280 --> 01:19:26.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May pagkakaiba po ba sila?

asr-000952
01:19:26.540 --> 01:19:34.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa mga elected kasi na councillors, members ng sanggunian ito, specific law yung nag-provide sa kanila.

asr-000953
01:19:34.520 --> 01:19:35.760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nag-grant ng eligibility.

asr-000954
01:19:36.500 --> 01:19:48.940
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kaya nga po madalas kaming makatanggap, nabigyan na yung mga barangay, pati yung elected officials ng barangay, appointed officials ng barangay, pinigyan na sila ng eligibility under the law.

asr-000955
01:19:49.280 --> 01:19:51.920
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nabigyan na rin yung mga lahat ng members ng sanggunian.

asr-000956
01:19:52.320 --> 01:19:54.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero yung mayor at saka yung governor, wala.

asr-000957
01:19:54.660 --> 01:19:58.400
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Wala po kasi dun sa batas na sila ay mapasali.

asr-000958
01:19:58.400 --> 01:20:03.400
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: In regards naman po sa indigenous peoples mandatory IPMRs,

asr-000959
