CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: eligibility, wala pa po kami ngayon.

asr-000960
01:20:10.040 --> 01:20:21.540
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But last budget hearing, one senator requested that if we could study the possibility of granting preferential treatment for indigenous peoples as a class.

asr-000961
01:20:22.340 --> 01:20:30.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Medyo nahirapan po kami doon, not only dahil nag-object ang indigenous, most representatives of indigenous peoples from Luzon.

asr-000962
01:20:31.500 --> 01:20:34.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero we asked our field offices in Visayas and Mindanao.

asr-000963
01:20:34.520 --> 01:20:38.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: To consult with their IPs kung pwede.

asr-000964
01:20:38.460 --> 01:20:44.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Although I recognize the difficulty because parang bibigyan mo sila ng preferential rating,

asr-000965
01:20:45.180 --> 01:20:53.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: dahil lang sa indigenous peoples sila parang medyo kailangan may some kind of qualifying standard.

asr-000966
01:20:54.360 --> 01:21:01.020
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But if they are kagaya ng at par sa condition ng nag-represent sa barangay council, sa sanggunian,

asr-000967
01:21:01.020 --> 01:21:03.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and other key government offices.

asr-000968
01:21:04.520 --> 01:21:06.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mandatory representative nga sila.

asr-000969
01:21:06.140 --> 01:21:14.520
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I think we can work at issuing a preferential rating system for IPMRs.

asr-000970
01:21:14.680 --> 01:21:15.180
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: For the meantime.

asr-000971
01:21:15.660 --> 01:21:17.840
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yeah, I think we can do it.

asr-000972
01:21:18.260 --> 01:21:22.760
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We have three months before the year ends.

asr-000973
