CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero pwersahan na po yata ito.

asr-000978
01:21:31.380 --> 01:21:31.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sorry.

asr-000979
01:21:31.900 --> 01:21:34.280
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: But meron po tayong basis ngayon.

asr-000980
01:21:34.520 --> 01:21:36.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi nagsilbi sila sa pamahalan.

asr-000981
01:21:37.100 --> 01:21:40.240
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mandatory representative sila sa key government agencies.

asr-000982
01:21:40.440 --> 01:21:48.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So we can probably extend the coverage of the civil service preferential rating eligibility for IPMRs.

asr-000983
