Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: especially on

asr-001181
01:29:02.800 --> 01:29:05.480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the hiring positions

asr-001182
01:29:05.480 --> 01:29:07.480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: in Adila Sirati Memorial Hospital.

asr-001183
01:29:07.720 --> 01:29:09.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, ngayon po,

asr-001184
01:29:09.660 --> 01:29:11.560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: if you can approve it, they can

asr-001185
01:29:11.560 --> 01:29:13.640
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: start already the process

asr-001186
01:29:13.640 --> 01:29:15.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: of hiring po, which is very much needed

asr-001187
01:29:15.520 --> 01:29:17.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: sa ngayon sa hospital po.

asr-001188
01:29:17.960 --> 01:29:19.780
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Opo, I will just ask

asr-001189
01:29:19.780 --> 01:29:21.220
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: if na-submit na po yung

asr-001190
01:29:21.220 --> 01:29:23.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: documents, requests,

asr-001191
01:29:23.640 --> 01:29:25.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka yung required additional documents

asr-001192
01:29:25.860 --> 01:29:27.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ng QS.

asr-001193
01:29:27.620 --> 01:29:29.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: For example, we can have

asr-001194
01:29:29.640 --> 01:29:31.440
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: a copy of the DOH

asr-001195
01:29:31.440 --> 01:29:32.480
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: circular.

asr-001196
01:29:33.940 --> 01:29:35.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Magpapakuha po ako, but I will

asr-001197
01:29:35.720 --> 01:29:37.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: verify with the region kung naka-invite.

asr-001198
01:29:37.720 --> 01:29:39.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I-submit na po ninyo yung lahat ng mga

asr-001199
01:29:39.600 --> 01:29:41.960
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: requirements. At kung na-transmit

asr-001200
01:29:41.960 --> 01:29:43.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: na dito sa

asr-001201
01:29:43.880 --> 01:29:45.220
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: central office.

asr-001202
01:29:46.120 --> 01:29:46.320
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ano?

asr-001203
01:29:49.520 --> 01:29:51.280
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ma'am, mga isang buwan na po yun

asr-001204
01:29:51.280 --> 01:29:52.560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: na-submit nila.

asr-001208
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:13.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Okay, okay. Yeah, yeah. Yeah, we will trace the documents and then look at them accordingly and we will get back to you. I will ask Ariel, ASCOM Ariel, to directly coordinate with you.

asr-001209
01:30:13.860 --> 01:30:31.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero ang sa akin po kasi, from sa bare na information na ibinigay ninyo po sa akin, ang sinabi ninyo, mas mataas kaysa QS na binibigay ng CSC. Ang CSC is minimum qualification requirements.

asr-001210
01:30:31.460 --> 01:30:38.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Agencies have the general power and authority to put it into a higher level of qualification standards.

asr-001211
01:30:38.740 --> 01:30:43.740
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So, from that general principle, baka ho natin

asr-001212
01:30:43.860 --> 01:30:48.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: mapag-aralan at maisaayos yung request ninyo as soonest possible time.

asr-001212-split-2
01:30:48.160 --> 01:30:53.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: That's the reason po. Nangangailangan sila ng inyong approval whether to adopt or not.

asr-001213
01:30:54.000 --> 01:30:58.220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil they are anticipating later on mga legal actions.

asr-001214
01:30:58.440 --> 01:31:03.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung halimbawa, right away they will adopt the DOH dahil meron ho kayong guidelines din.

asr-001215
01:31:03.580 --> 01:31:12.040
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pero kung may express approval na po ng civil service, I think medyo safe na sila sa kanilang pagpili ng bagong mga physicians.

asr-001216
01:31:12.100 --> 01:31:13.340
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We will act po immediately on that request.

asr-001217
01:31:13.340 --> 01:31:13.680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Salamat po.

asr-001218
01:31:13.860 --> 01:31:16.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you very much.

asr-001219
01:31:17.120 --> 01:31:18.980
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: That's all, Madam Chair.

asr-001220
01:31:19.860 --> 01:31:21.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much, Rep. Momo.

asr-001221
01:31:22.140 --> 01:31:26.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Next to Interpelate, Representative Elijah John Fernando.

asr-001222
01:31:28.140 --> 01:31:29.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

asr-001223
01:31:30.180 --> 01:31:37.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dito po sa report ninyo, Madam Chairperson, dumami ang bilang ng mga JO at COS sa National Government Agencies.

asr-001224
01:31:38.380 --> 01:31:43.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano po ang mga ahensya na may pinakamaraming bilang ng JOs at COS?

asr-001225
01:31:43.860 --> 01:31:44.260
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Meron tayo?

asr-001226
01:31:46.400 --> 01:31:48.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kahit yung top five, top ten.

asr-001227
01:31:48.560 --> 01:31:48.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ikaw, ikaw.

asr-001228
01:31:49.080 --> 01:31:49.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ikaw.

asr-001229
01:31:50.560 --> 01:31:51.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Can I ask him?

asr-001230
01:31:51.620 --> 01:31:53.980
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi siya ang may hawak ng datos dito.

asr-001231
01:31:54.800 --> 01:31:56.020
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001232
01:31:56.020 --> 01:32:09.020
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: The national government agencies with the highest number of JOs are the DPWH, DPWH, DOH, DSWD,

asr-001233
01:32:09.820 --> 01:32:14.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: and yeah, that's the four highest.

asr-001234
01:32:15.040 --> 01:32:15.180
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: This is your question?

asr-001235
01:32:15.180 --> 01:32:15.200
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Yes, sir.

asr-001236
01:32:15.200 --> 01:32:24.820
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ang common feature nila, Madam Chair, is that sila yung namimigay ng mga welfare benefits.

asr-001237
01:32:25.020 --> 01:32:28.980
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kaya seasonal at episodic minsan yung mga ibang mga pangangailangan nila.

asr-001238
01:32:29.400 --> 01:32:37.140
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: That's what we can attribute yung pagdami ng number of JOs sa kanila.

asr-001239
01:32:37.140 --> 01:32:57.360
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: To be precise, Madam Chair, DPWH ang pinakamarami at 44,870, Department of Health at 35,183, Department of Education at 35,014, Department of Social Welfare and Development at 23,819, and rounding up the top five is DENR at 12,840.

asr-001240
01:32:58.760 --> 01:33:01.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makihingi na lang po kami ng copy, Madam Chairperson.

asr-001241
01:33:03.380 --> 01:33:05.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Marami na pong mga issuances na nilabas.

asr-001242
01:33:05.800 --> 01:33:19.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang CSC at DBM na sinasabi, ang mga job order at contract of service ay dapat hindi gagampan ng trabaho gaya ng isang regular na empleyado.

asr-001243
01:33:19.840 --> 01:33:20.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po ba to?

asr-001244
01:33:21.500 --> 01:33:22.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po.

asr-001245
01:33:22.440 --> 01:33:22.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po.

asr-001246
01:33:23.500 --> 01:33:32.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero nakakapagtaka po, Madam Chair, sa mismong datos ng gobyerno, napakarami ng bilang ng mga job order at contract of service

asr-001247
01:33:32.780 --> 01:33:35.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na nagtatrabaho ng mahigit anim na taon o higit pa.

asr-001248
01:33:35.800 --> 01:33:40.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ibig sabihin nito, Madam Chair,

asr-001249
01:33:41.260 --> 01:33:43.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: eh, kumbaga, kung nasa pribadong sektor lang ho tayo,

asr-001250
01:33:45.140 --> 01:33:47.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: numero unong violator, last year, ito rin po sinabi ko eh,

asr-001251
01:33:48.300 --> 01:33:53.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: numero unong violator ang gobyerno ng labor code, kung nasa pribadong sektor lang tayo.

asr-001252
01:33:54.320 --> 01:33:56.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi usually necessary and desirable na itong mga to eh.

asr-001253
01:33:57.600 --> 01:33:59.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi paulit-ulit lang naman sila,

asr-001254
01:33:59.680 --> 01:34:03.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na hinahire ng mga job order at contract of service,

asr-001255
01:34:03.660 --> 01:34:05.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: doing the same regular job,

asr-001256
01:34:05.800 --> 01:34:08.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: all over again, sa iba't-ibang ahensya ng gobyerno.

asr-001257
01:34:08.800 --> 01:34:11.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, mismong datos na ng CSA, nagsasabi nito.

asr-001258
01:34:11.800 --> 01:34:13.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, ang tanong ko, Madam Chairperson, eh,

asr-001259
01:34:13.800 --> 01:34:18.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung ganito po ang kalakaran sa National Government Agency, sa gobyerno mismo,

asr-001260
01:34:18.800 --> 01:34:23.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ano yung mga corrective measure or action na ginagawa ng Civil Service Commission?

asr-001261
01:34:26.800 --> 01:34:30.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Madam Chair, may I be allowed to have a little latitude in answering the question?

asr-001262
01:34:30.800 --> 01:34:34.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kasi medyo complex po yung issue ng JOKO sa gobyerno natin.

asr-001263
01:34:34.800 --> 01:34:35.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Eh, eh, eh.

asr-001264
01:34:35.800 --> 01:34:38.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: If the Honorable Ellie would grant that.

asr-001265
01:34:38.800 --> 01:34:40.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ah, I share with the frustration of everyone,

asr-001266
01:34:40.800 --> 01:34:44.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: like si Congressman Nazal kanina, tsaka si Congressman San Fernando.

asr-001267
01:34:44.800 --> 01:34:49.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: And I agree that there are really employees who should have been made permanent by now,

asr-001268
01:34:49.800 --> 01:34:54.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: because they've been engaged for work by their government agencies continuously for several years already,

asr-001269
01:34:54.800 --> 01:34:59.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: leading one to conclude that their functions are regular and necessary.

asr-001270
01:34:59.800 --> 01:35:04.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: But on the other hand, Madam Chair, I also personally believe that the COSJOs,

asr-001271
01:35:04.800 --> 01:35:11.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: this unemployment arrangement, is still crucial for projects and programs that are temporary or episodic in nature,

asr-001272
01:35:11.800 --> 01:35:14.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: such as welfare distribution activities and others.

asr-001273
01:35:14.800 --> 01:35:23.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: This explains why among NGAs, DPWH, DOH, DSWD account for the most number of COSJOs.

asr-001274
01:35:23.800 --> 01:35:32.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: It would be financially irresponsible to convert the second category to permanent positions because of the basic nature of their work,

asr-001275
01:35:32.800 --> 01:35:39.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: which is to temporarily and seasonably distribute welfare benefits.

asr-001276
01:35:39.800 --> 01:35:45.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: But I agree, Mr. Congressman, that the challenge for all of us is how to minimize,

asr-001277
01:35:45.800 --> 01:35:49.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: if not eliminate, the first category of workers engaged as COSJOs.

asr-001278
01:35:49.800 --> 01:35:59.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Yung dinescribe niyo po na performing functions that are regular, desirable, and necessary for the particular agency.

asr-001279
01:35:59.800 --> 01:36:01.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: While we do not have the exact answers that will guarantee the total elimination,

asr-001280
01:36:01.800 --> 01:36:06.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: of COS and JOs in that first category, Madam Chair,

asr-001281
01:36:06.800 --> 01:36:09.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: I believe the following can help address the situation,

asr-001282
01:36:09.800 --> 01:36:11.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: some of which are my personal opinion.

asr-001283
01:36:11.800 --> 01:36:16.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Hindi po namin na pag-usapan pa sa CSC yung mga specific action points na ito.

asr-001284
01:36:16.800 --> 01:36:22.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Pero paalis na po ako sa komisyon, so baka may latitude po ako na magsabi ng mga sarili kong saluobin

asr-001285
01:36:22.800 --> 01:36:27.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kung ano dapat ang, ano tingin ko ang pwede nating mga measures na pwedeng i-adapt.

asr-001286
01:36:27.800 --> 01:36:28.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Go ahead, sir.

asr-001287
01:36:28.800 --> 01:36:29.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Number one po.

asr-001288
01:36:29.800 --> 01:36:30.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: The DILG has two questions.

asr-001289
01:36:30.800 --> 01:36:31.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Go ahead, sir.

asr-001290
01:36:31.800 --> 01:36:38.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: First, we need to conduct a scientific study to determine whether the rigid PS caps or PS limitations of LGUs remain relevant

asr-001291
01:36:38.800 --> 01:36:43.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: and or whether a cap on the number of JOs and COS in LGUs must be implemented.

asr-001292
01:36:43.800 --> 01:36:56.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: And they should coordinate with DBM on how to use this PS cap to administer or to regulate the number of COS and LGUs.

asr-001293
01:36:56.800 --> 01:36:59.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Each LGU has unique needs and unique capacities.

asr-001294
01:36:59.800 --> 01:37:00.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Alam po, suguro niyo yan.

asr-001295
01:37:00.800 --> 01:37:10.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: This will be the greatest challenge po because out of the total number of JOs and COS in government, 70% po, 70% po ay nasa LGUs.

asr-001296
01:37:10.800 --> 01:37:21.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So makakatulong po dito kaya namin isinusulong yung sana magkaroon ng HRMO na professional, permanent mandatory positions sa bawat LGU

asr-001297
01:37:21.800 --> 01:37:27.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: para ma-assist po ang mga LGUs in processing their recruitment, selection, and appointment needs.

asr-001298
01:37:27.800 --> 01:37:28.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kasi baka some of these po ay caused by the government.

asr-001299
01:37:28.800 --> 01:37:36.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Baka some of these po ay caused by the fact na medyo matagal at nahihirapan yung LGUs to perform all the necessary recruitment,

asr-001300
01:37:36.800 --> 01:37:42.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: selection, and appointment of workers which includes JOs and COS.

asr-001301
01:37:42.800 --> 01:37:50.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Number two po, baka malaki din po ang role ng Congress because I think we have to carefully review present laws

asr-001302
01:37:50.800 --> 01:37:55.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: that create mandatory positions without regard to the needs and capacities of the particular LGUs.

asr-001303
01:37:55.800 --> 01:37:56.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: While the intention in the creation of mandatory positions,

asr-001304
01:37:56.800 --> 01:37:57.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: While the intention in the creation of mandatory positions,

asr-001305
01:37:57.800 --> 01:37:58.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: While the intention in the creation of mandatory positions,

asr-001306
01:37:58.800 --> 01:37:59.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: is noble po.

asr-001307
01:37:59.800 --> 01:38:03.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: If done indiscriminately regardless of the capability of the LGUs,

asr-001308
01:38:03.800 --> 01:38:10.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: it incapacitates po yung low-income LGUs who cannot afford to create these mandatory department head positions

asr-001309
01:38:10.800 --> 01:38:11.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: para makapag-

asr-001310
01:38:11.800 --> 01:38:16.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kasi po pag nag-create ka ng mga bababawang posisyon pero hindi ka na-create ng mandatory posisyon,

asr-001311
01:38:16.800 --> 01:38:19.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: bawal po yun at i-invalidate po namin yun.

asr-001312
01:38:19.800 --> 01:38:25.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So dahil may mga mandatory na matataas na posisyon na hindi kaya sa budget ng LGU na mag-create ng mga gantong posisyon,

asr-001313
01:38:25.800 --> 01:38:26.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: hindi po nagagawan ng plantilya positions na hindi kaya sa budget ng LGUs na mag-create ng mga gantong posisyon,

asr-001314
01:38:26.800 --> 01:38:32.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: hindi po nagagawan ng plantilya positions ng ibang LGUs yung mga utility nila na antagal nang nagtatrabaho sa kanila.

asr-001315
01:38:32.800 --> 01:38:35.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So baka kailangan po ng masinsinang pag-aaral dun sa mga batas.

asr-001316
01:38:35.800 --> 01:38:40.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: And currently po on the part of the CSC tulad ng tanong ni Congressman Eli kanina on what we're doing,

asr-001317
01:38:40.800 --> 01:38:45.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: may current discussion po kami, may nakasalang na matter on this particular subject matter

asr-001318
01:38:45.800 --> 01:38:55.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: and hopefully within this year po makakapag-recommend kami ng way forward on how we can recommend to the Congress

asr-001319
01:38:55.800 --> 01:39:01.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kung ano yung mga posisyons na lagyan naman ng nuance kung mandatory or optional dapat siya

asr-001320
01:39:01.800 --> 01:39:07.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: at hindi na lang basta i-dikta sa mga LGUs na mandatory siya kasi ang laki po ng impact sa mga LGUs

asr-001321
01:39:07.800 --> 01:39:13.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: in their ability to hire or to create plantilya positions for their long-standing COS and JOs.

asr-001322
01:39:13.800 --> 01:39:20.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Number three na pwede pong i-consider natin na solusyon sa problema, at the risk of offending the DBM po,

asr-001323
01:39:20.800 --> 01:39:24.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: I think it should relax its insistence on the scrap and build as a matter of default policy.

asr-001324
01:39:25.800 --> 01:39:34.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Many government agencies keep their obsolete positions vacant so that they have something to scrap when a need to create a position comes around.

asr-001325
01:39:34.800 --> 01:39:40.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Instead, I believe we should craft an honest-to-goodness policy where a government agency can create positions it

asr-001326
01:39:40.800 --> 01:39:44.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: legitimately needs without having to find any position to scrap.

asr-001327
01:39:44.800 --> 01:39:49.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: As a counterbalance naman, kasi naiintindihan naman natin kung saan nanggagaling ang DBM,

asr-001328
01:39:49.800 --> 01:39:54.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: the offices in charge of optimization should expedite analyzing

asr-001329
01:39:55.800 --> 01:39:59.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: longstanding vacant positions and pursue the removal in the government inventory of plantilla positions if found meritorious.

asr-001330
01:39:59.800 --> 01:40:05.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kasi po kahit sinasight natin na ang daming vacancy kanina, ang katotohanan, some of it obsolete na kaya hindi nila pinupunan

asr-001331
01:40:05.800 --> 01:40:08.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: pero nire-reserba nila para pag nangailangan sila ng ipapa-create na posisyon

asr-001332
01:40:08.800 --> 01:40:15.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: meron silang i-offer sa DBM na i-scrap para makapag-build sila ng isa.

asr-001333
01:40:15.800 --> 01:40:22.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: And finally, as an improvement sa ongoing po na work na ang partner po namin si Commissioner Louie ang in-charge on the part of CSC

asr-001334
01:40:22.800 --> 01:40:24.800
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: pagdating sa committee on optimization.

asr-001335
01:40:25.800 --> 01:40:33.240
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: I believe po, I submit po na dapat, we should not wait for an omnibus recommendation for the whole bureaucracy.

asr-001336
01:40:33.680 --> 01:40:37.640
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Masyado pong matagal at masyado pong maraming workers ang dadaanan nito.

asr-001337
01:40:37.820 --> 01:40:43.840
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kaya kung sana per agency natin i-analyze yung staffing needs niya at i-implement na natin agad,

asr-001338
01:40:43.960 --> 01:40:45.560
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: mas mabilis po yun dapat na mangyari.

asr-001339
01:40:46.100 --> 01:40:52.900
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: These matters po ay on the demand side, on the supply side ng pagkontrol ng JOs and COS.

asr-001340
01:40:52.900 --> 01:41:00.680
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: On the demand side naman po, I recognize po yung attractiveness on the part of agencies na mas madali kasi mag-hire ng JOs at COS.

asr-001341
01:41:00.880 --> 01:41:06.440
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Hindi siya dadaan sa masusing at masalimut na proseso, mas matagal siya.

asr-001342
01:41:06.560 --> 01:41:08.420
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: E sa mandala ng JOs and COS, ambilis niya.

asr-001343
01:41:08.760 --> 01:41:19.180
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So siguro pwede siguro pong i-consider ng mga bumubuo ng optimization committee na part of their work is to explore the possibility na may mga trigger points po.

asr-001344
01:41:19.180 --> 01:41:22.400
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Na pag itong ahensya nito, parati na lang nag-hire.

asr-001345
01:41:22.400 --> 01:41:30.220
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Repeatedly hire COS and JOs for the same position for a number of years may trigger na automatic magkakaroon ng review

asr-001346
01:41:30.220 --> 01:41:35.900
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kung na ibibigay mo yung burden sa kanya to justify bakit patuloy na ginagawa niya ito para ma-shift po yung burden.

asr-001347
01:41:36.260 --> 01:41:43.320
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Ang CSA po, we join with your desire na mabawasan yung COS and JOs pero medyo tali po yung kamay namin

asr-001348
01:41:43.320 --> 01:41:49.980
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: at yun lang po yung medyo limitado kaya namin i-offer on top of our policies na like yung preference rating nga po

asr-001349
01:41:49.980 --> 01:41:56.660
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: para maibsan yung problema na may mga hindi nakakapasa eh kahit papano makatulong kami dito sa pag-solve ng problem.

asr-001350
01:41:56.760 --> 01:42:02.380
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: But I agree, this is a very difficult problem, Kong. I agree with you. Masalimutang problema.

asr-001351
01:42:03.020 --> 01:42:12.660
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Pero may mga, tulad ng in-outline ko po, may mga four siguran na general concepts na pwede nating i-pursue to finally at least, at least man lang,

asr-001352
01:42:12.660 --> 01:42:17.640
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: minimize yung prevalence po ng JOs, COS in the first category.

asr-001353
01:42:17.640 --> 01:42:26.400
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Kasi yung second category po na ginagamit siya for temporary and episodic, talagang importante po siya para maging agile ang ating gobyerno.

asr-001354
01:42:26.500 --> 01:42:32.960
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Na hindi po pwedeng i-permanent mo yan kasi may captured money ka dyan na sinusweldohan mo walang ginagawa.

asr-001355
01:42:33.120 --> 01:42:42.500
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: So I still believe po na COS and JOs, when employed correctly, e malaking bagay in making sure na agile po yung gobyerno natin.

asr-001356
01:42:42.580 --> 01:42:43.520
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Thank you very much, Madam Chair.

asr-001357
01:42:43.520 --> 01:42:44.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you.

asr-001358
01:42:44.160 --> 01:42:48.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I agree with most of your observations.

asr-001359
01:42:49.960 --> 01:42:51.940
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero nagiging lusot nga eh.

asr-001360
01:42:52.960 --> 01:43:02.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Itong mga ganitong butas para mapanatili na perpetually contractual yung karamihan ng mga manggagawa na po pwede naman irregular.

asr-001361
01:43:03.120 --> 01:43:13.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Alam niyo po, last year during the plenary budget deliberation, yung CSC sinabi, kahit ngayon po sinasabi niyo, labas sa jurisdiction niyo ang mga JO at COS.

asr-001362
01:43:14.160 --> 01:43:16.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At yan ay nasa regulasyon ng DBM.

asr-001363
01:43:17.280 --> 01:43:19.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero tinanong din po natin ang DBM.

asr-001364
01:43:19.580 --> 01:43:21.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang tinuro, pabalik kayo, CSC.

asr-001365
01:43:22.280 --> 01:43:23.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi, kay Rojo ang may problema.

asr-001366
01:43:23.980 --> 01:43:27.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung qualification standards niyo, eh kailangan nang i-review.

asr-001367
01:43:27.540 --> 01:43:29.820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So ano po ang comment dito ng Civil Service Commission?

asr-001368
01:43:29.940 --> 01:43:31.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi nagtuturuan po tayo dito eh.

asr-001369
01:43:31.840 --> 01:43:33.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tuturo ng CSC, DBM.

asr-001370
01:43:33.720 --> 01:43:35.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sasabi ng DBM, wala, wala sa aming problema.

asr-001371
01:43:35.920 --> 01:43:37.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Problema nandun sa CSC.

asr-001372
01:43:37.600 --> 01:43:38.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Chairperson.

asr-001373
01:43:39.040 --> 01:43:41.800
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kung wala, hindi ko.

asr-001374
01:43:41.920 --> 01:43:44.140
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ayoko nung nagpapasa-pasa ng ano yung turo.

asr-001375
01:43:44.160 --> 01:43:48.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: In charge po sa qualification standards kami.

asr-001376
01:43:49.600 --> 01:43:51.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero pag-create ng positions, hindi na.

asr-001377
01:43:51.960 --> 01:43:54.040
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tinanggal sa Civil Service yan eh.

asr-001378
01:43:54.480 --> 01:43:57.300
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Classification ng positions, tinanggal sa amin yan eh.

asr-001379
01:43:57.420 --> 01:44:01.880
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero sa mandato namin na talaga, sa Constitution of EO 292,

asr-001380
01:44:02.160 --> 01:44:03.520
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yan dapat ay magkakasama.

asr-001381
01:44:03.640 --> 01:44:05.500
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi integrated na system yan eh.

asr-001382
01:44:05.880 --> 01:44:08.860
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung count mo ng manpower, yung deployment ng manpower,

asr-001383
01:44:09.220 --> 01:44:11.620
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: qualification standards, position qualification,

asr-001384
01:44:11.620 --> 01:44:14.100
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: dapat iisang integrated na sistema.

asr-001385
01:44:14.160 --> 01:44:16.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pinaghiwalay yung sistema.

asr-001386
01:44:16.160 --> 01:44:19.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: This is what we are living on right now.

asr-001387
01:44:19.160 --> 01:44:25.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ngayon, hindi ko talaga i-deny, hindi ito cop out na hindi namin sila saklaw.

asr-001388
01:44:25.160 --> 01:44:29.160
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi talagang sa mandato namin hindi kasama ang JOs and COs

asr-001389
