asr-001850
02:02:51.760 --> 02:03:04.760
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: Pero hindi siya necessarily jurisdiction. To cite an example, yung Solo Parent Act, for example, na covering proposed or argued to cover JOs at COs,

asr-001851
02:03:04.760 --> 02:03:08.320
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: ang may jurisdiction po yun. Kung pag-uusapan natin ang jurisdiction,

asr-001852
02:03:09.340 --> 02:03:19.660
CSC Commissioner Ryan Alvin R. Acosta: kasi ng subject matter na yun ay DSWD. So kung usapan ng jurisdiction on Solo Parent Act as applied to JOs and COs, yung DSWD po ang implementing agency for that.

asr-001853
02:03:20.460 --> 02:03:21.880
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Maraming salamat, Commissioner.

asr-001854
02:03:22.500 --> 02:03:31.500
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Pangalawang tanong, may kinalaman pa rin po sa JO. So ano ba yung passing rate natin ngayon sa civil service examination?

asr-001855
02:03:34.590 --> 02:03:35.150
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: 80.

asr-001856
02:03:35.870 --> 02:03:41.150
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So kanina ho nabanggit. So thank you po, ma'am. Kanina ho nabanggit na...

asr-001857
02:03:41.390 --> 02:03:53.290
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Nagkaroon ng pagbabago o amendment tungkol doon sa preferential rating system wherein yung JO ay kahit 5 years pa lang, pwede na.

asr-001858
02:03:53.290 --> 02:04:04.590
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So meaning, basta siya ay makakuha ng 70%, automatically, he or she will be considered as he passed the examination.

asr-001859
02:04:06.190 --> 02:04:11.290
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hindi po automatic yun mag-a-apply sa amin. Titignan po namin yung kanyang experience.

asr-001860
02:04:11.390 --> 02:04:13.890
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Experience at saka yung qualifications.

asr-001861
02:04:15.010 --> 02:04:17.470
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So subject to compliance o subject to...

asr-001862
02:04:17.470 --> 02:04:24.350
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May dagdag pa po na requirements aside from pagpasa doon sa eligibility exam.

asr-001863
02:04:24.770 --> 02:04:39.330
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Maraming salamat po. At least maliwanag na kahit na 5 taon pa lang, but pwede ka magkaroon ng permanent position, magkaroon ng item position, plantilia, subject to compliance sa mga necessary requirements.

asr-001864
02:04:39.330 --> 02:04:40.390
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Thank you po.

asr-001865
02:04:41.390 --> 02:04:54.390
