asr-001866
02:04:57.000 --> 02:05:01.780
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Hindi po, malakas po ako sa Juan, kaya...

asr-001867
02:05:01.780 --> 02:05:04.640
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: You still have one minute, Kong Bolivia.

asr-001868
02:05:12.930 --> 02:05:13.510
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Okay, sige.

asr-001869
02:05:13.950 --> 02:05:15.890
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Can I ask Kong Ariel?

asr-001870
02:05:16.190 --> 02:05:17.130
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Sige po, sige po.

asr-001871
02:05:17.190 --> 02:05:17.690
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kong Ariel.

asr-001872
02:05:17.690 --> 02:05:18.630
