asr-001874
02:05:20.570 --> 02:05:20.870
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Nice.

asr-001875
02:05:21.570 --> 02:05:22.970
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001876
02:05:23.970 --> 02:05:44.890
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, the contact center ng bayan in the Civil Service Commission is a program where the citizens can directly report any violation or any anomalies that they observe from different agencies of the government.

asr-001877
02:05:44.890 --> 02:05:59.020
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Now, in return, our contact center ng bayan will call the attention of the agency concerned regarding that reported wrongdoing or violation so that it can be acted upon immediately.

asr-001878
02:05:59.660 --> 02:06:02.070
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So, it's purely referral?

asr-001879
02:06:03.570 --> 02:06:17.770
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Well, in a way, Your Honor, but since we are also referring it to the proper agency and we are monitoring as to what action has been done on the matter that was referred to them,

asr-001880
02:06:17.770 --> 02:06:28.670
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: somehow, Mr. Chair, it is also giving the necessary redress to whoever has reported the observed wrongdoing.

asr-001881
02:06:29.090 --> 02:06:39.590
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So, meaning, yung nag-complain sa inyo o nagbigay ng tanong na, Juan, eh, sasagutin ninyo yun, base sa pagmamonitor nyo sa ikinomplain niya?

asr-001882
02:06:39.890 --> 02:06:46.230
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Opo, opo. He will know what is the status of the matter that he complained with the contact center ng bayan.

asr-001883
02:06:46.230 --> 02:06:47.330
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So, is it true?

asr-001884
02:06:47.770 --> 02:06:52.990
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: A written reply or merely a verbal na pag-agpalit sa inyo?

asr-001885
02:06:52.990 --> 02:07:10.990
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: It is written po kasi ang contact center ng bayan nag-gagawa po sila ng, meron po silang mechanism to record kung ano po yung mga report na natanggap nila and then in writing also they give a report to whoever files the complaint.

asr-001886
02:07:10.990 --> 02:07:27.290
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Pagdating naman po sa inyong data management system, kanina nabanggit nyo, napakaganda yung ginagawa nyo yung innovation, yung bagong programa nyo wherein lahat ng PDS, eh, digitalized na, ini-encode na ng Juan.

asr-001887
02:07:27.290 --> 02:07:40.290
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: So, pagdating naman po sa ating mga cases na being handled administratively or in whatever type of cases, meron po ba kayong case management system na pwedeng...

asr-001888
02:07:40.990 --> 02:07:46.010
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: I-track ang lahat ng mga kaso filed to anybody?

asr-001889
02:07:46.470 --> 02:07:46.750
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Yes.

asr-001890
02:07:47.470 --> 02:07:49.550
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-001891
02:07:50.890 --> 02:08:02.050
