asr-001892
02:08:02.310 --> 02:08:02.610
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Thank you.

asr-001893
02:08:02.850 --> 02:08:03.290
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Thank you.

asr-001894
