CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Assistant Commissioner po.

asr-001895
02:08:05.870 --> 02:08:08.250
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Yes, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair.

asr-001896
02:08:08.250 --> 02:08:10.250
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Meron po kami yung tinatawag na electronic...

asr-001897
02:08:10.990 --> 02:08:13.350
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: ...case and document management system.

asr-001898
02:08:13.910 --> 02:08:21.210
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: We can track and monitor all the cases that are being filed with the Civil Service Commission in all offices of the Commission po nationwide.

asr-001899
02:08:21.530 --> 02:08:36.530
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Hindi lang po sa Central Office na tatrack po namin because of the ECDMS and we are also in the process of improving it by introducing the CLAS, the Civil Service Legal and Administrative Service System.

asr-001900
02:08:36.530 --> 02:08:40.930
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So, meron po. It's an existing program po within the Commission.

asr-001901
02:08:40.990 --> 02:08:42.230
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair.

asr-001902
02:08:42.530 --> 02:08:43.670
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Thank you, Assistant Commissioner.

asr-001903
02:08:43.830 --> 02:08:44.830
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Last question na daw ako.

