Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: ...their office in my capacity as the Chairperson of the Civil Service Committee.

asr-001913
02:09:15.710 --> 02:09:26.470
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Ako ho'y naawa dahil yung kanilang building at yung kanilang mga ibang kagamitan plus yung mga field offices nila na pinakita nila,

asr-001914
