CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, tama po yun.

asr-001975
02:14:18.450 --> 02:14:21.730
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Under the rules, under certain circumstances, instead of the...

asr-001976
02:14:22.110 --> 02:14:24.890
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Agencies CODI, pwede pong i-file sa CSC.

asr-001977
02:14:25.430 --> 02:14:34.850
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And yes po, meron po kaming some cases ng sexual harassment involving officials and employees of other agencies, Madam Chair.

asr-001978
