asr-002594
02:36:57.280 --> 02:36:59.420
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: kung paano i-treat-treat yung public sector

asr-002595
02:36:59.420 --> 02:37:01.720
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: representation. Kasi yun din ang problema

asr-002596
02:37:01.720 --> 02:37:02.580
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: namin dun sa

asr-002597
