asr-002598
02:37:04.780 --> 02:37:07.600
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: team. Kasi

asr-002599
02:37:07.600 --> 02:37:09.700
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ang hirap, walang

asr-002600
02:37:09.700 --> 02:37:11.180
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: mechanism dun for selecting

asr-002601
02:37:11.180 --> 02:37:13.520
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: labor sector representatives. So what

