asr-002631
02:37:51.770 --> 02:37:53.310
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Brian Poe, you are recognized.

asr-002632
02:37:53.570 --> 02:37:53.950
Rep. Brian Poe: Sige po.

asr-002633
02:37:54.370 --> 02:37:55.350
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-002634
02:37:55.510 --> 02:38:01.150
Rep. Brian Poe: Thank you, of course, to the Civil Service Commission for making the time to be here today.

asr-002635
02:38:02.210 --> 02:38:03.010
Rep. Brian Poe: Yun nga po.

asr-002636
02:38:03.130 --> 02:38:05.830
Rep. Brian Poe: I just want to follow up on my questions from last year.

asr-002637
02:38:06.370 --> 02:38:09.690
Rep. Brian Poe: So last year, I brought up the concern regarding cyber security.

asr-002638
02:38:09.910 --> 02:38:12.330
Rep. Brian Poe: Yung hacking na nangyari nung August.

asr-002639
02:38:12.790 --> 02:38:17.790
Rep. Brian Poe: Now, I want to understand where we are in terms of cyber security for the Civil Service Commission.

asr-002640
02:38:18.850 --> 02:38:21.630
Rep. Brian Poe: I went through your budget proposal for NEP.

asr-002641
02:38:21.630 --> 02:38:24.630
Rep. Brian Poe: Parang wala po ako nakitang specific item for...

asr-002642
02:38:25.510 --> 02:38:27.190
Rep. Brian Poe: for cyber security.

asr-002643
02:38:27.610 --> 02:38:32.230
Rep. Brian Poe: Pero meron po kayong 1.4 billion pesos para sa modernization.

asr-002644
02:38:32.750 --> 02:38:35.910
Rep. Brian Poe: Meron po ba tayong subcategory dito para sa cyber?

asr-002645
02:38:37.910 --> 02:38:45.750
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Integral po doon sa Prime EGS at saka sa HRMISPS yung cyber security.

asr-002646
02:38:45.750 --> 02:38:53.890
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero aside from the provisions in the PCSMP, we are now drafting a manual.

asr-002647
02:38:54.630 --> 02:38:54.750
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Parang...

asr-002648
02:38:55.510 --> 02:39:00.910
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It will be circularized, but it is a data privacy and cyber security manual.

asr-002649
02:39:01.530 --> 02:39:06.330
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It's taking us a little bit of time kasi pinagdudugtong namin yung data privacy

asr-002650
02:39:06.330 --> 02:39:10.350
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka yung latest na cyber security issuances from the House

asr-002651
02:39:10.350 --> 02:39:15.130
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: and yung implementation schema ng DICT.

asr-002652
02:39:16.310 --> 02:39:21.650
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasama po, integral na po sa lahat ng aming digital programs for the next three years

asr-002653
02:39:21.650 --> 02:39:24.330
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: ay robust cyber security provisions.

asr-002654
02:39:25.510 --> 02:39:31.310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kami po ang isa sa mga pinaka-porous na organizations dito sa ano.

asr-002655
02:39:31.710 --> 02:39:32.910
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Lalo na at ano ba yun?

asr-002656
02:39:33.970 --> 02:39:36.410
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Analog lahat karamihan ng aming datos.

asr-002657
02:39:36.630 --> 02:39:38.250
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So ngayon ay medyo ano na kami.

asr-002658
02:39:39.110 --> 02:39:44.790
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mas watchful na kami dito sa data privacy plus cyber security.

asr-002659
02:39:44.790 --> 02:39:49.790
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Wala po magandang digitalization kung hindi po integral ang cyber security.

asr-002660
02:39:50.910 --> 02:39:52.250
Rep. Brian Poe: Tama po yan, Madam Chair.

asr-002661
02:39:52.510 --> 02:39:54.790
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, gusto ko malaman kung magkano talaga...

asr-002662
02:39:55.510 --> 02:39:58.250
Rep. Brian Poe: yung naka-allocate para sa cyber security.

asr-002663
02:39:58.670 --> 02:40:00.130
Rep. Brian Poe: Meron po tayong hard figure?

asr-002664
02:40:00.470 --> 02:40:01.350
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Meron na ba?

asr-002665
02:40:01.890 --> 02:40:03.790
Rep. Brian Poe: Kasi kailangan po bantayan yan sa budget.

asr-002666
02:40:03.930 --> 02:40:04.270
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yes, sir.

asr-002667
02:40:04.590 --> 02:40:08.570
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: We cannot fix a specific ano kasi naka-integrate siya ngayon dun sa programa

asr-002668
02:40:08.570 --> 02:40:11.750
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: but can we submit it to you after this meeting

asr-002669
02:40:11.750 --> 02:40:17.270
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para ma-disaggregate niya yung para sa Prime ESG, para sa HRMISPS

asr-002670
02:40:17.270 --> 02:40:23.150
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: at saka yung para sa dun sa other digital programs ng CSC.

asr-002671
02:40:23.150 --> 02:40:23.890
Rep. Brian Poe: Yes, po.

asr-002672
02:40:24.090 --> 02:40:25.150
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Chair, I'll request that...

asr-002673
02:40:25.510 --> 02:40:30.890
Rep. Brian Poe: I'll request that from the Civil Service Commission kasi ang ayoko mangyari baka mamaya

asr-002674
02:40:30.890 --> 02:40:37.130
Rep. Brian Poe: yung budget para sa cyber security mabawasan or matanggal dahil hindi namin napansin

asr-002675
02:40:37.130 --> 02:40:40.670
Rep. Brian Poe: or lumped in siya sa ibang budget item.

asr-002676
02:40:41.170 --> 02:40:44.450
Rep. Brian Poe: Critical po yung cyber security natin para sa civil service

asr-002677
02:40:44.450 --> 02:40:49.930
Rep. Brian Poe: because as I see here, you're now going very hard into digital services, no?

asr-002678
02:40:50.510 --> 02:40:54.630
Rep. Brian Poe: In fact, you have new rules regarding your salen

asr-002679
02:40:54.630 --> 02:40:55.490
Rep. Brian Poe: Yes, sir.

asr-002680
02:40:55.510 --> 02:41:00.810
Rep. Brian Poe: to now be submitted via online oath-taking, online filing, and digital submission.

asr-002681
02:41:00.970 --> 02:41:01.450
Rep. Brian Poe: Tama po ba?

asr-002682
02:41:01.510 --> 02:41:01.810
Rep. Brian Poe: Yes, po.

asr-002683
02:41:01.930 --> 02:41:02.330
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yes, po.

asr-002684
02:41:02.650 --> 02:41:06.890
Rep. Brian Poe: So, I want to ask about this online filing ng salen.

asr-002685
02:41:06.890 --> 02:41:13.370
Rep. Brian Poe: Ano yung mga safety measures or authentication measures that you're putting in place?

asr-002686
02:41:13.830 --> 02:41:20.290
Rep. Brian Poe: Kasi syempre, online oath-taking, et cetera, paano natin ma-verify na totoong oath-taking yung nangyari

asr-002687
02:41:20.290 --> 02:41:25.010
Rep. Brian Poe: at hindi magiging lusot yan later on na hindi po ako yan?

asr-002688
02:41:25.010 --> 02:41:31.850
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May I ask as Com. Kilio?

asr-002689
02:41:32.090 --> 02:41:36.590
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: In-charge po siya doon sa oath-taking and other digital signatures for our program.

asr-002690
02:41:36.710 --> 02:41:37.630
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Opo. Thank you po.

asr-002691
02:41:37.730 --> 02:41:43.710
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Madam Chair, sir, doon po sa ating rules, the new omnibus rules on salen,

asr-002692
02:41:44.250 --> 02:41:50.690
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: yung pong online oath-taking, meron pong very specific procedure on how it will be taken.

asr-002693
02:41:50.690 --> 02:41:54.690
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: At ang first step po doon ay yung verification ng identification.

asr-002694
02:41:55.010 --> 02:41:59.310
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: It is ng oath administrator at saka yung person who is taking the oath.

asr-002695
02:42:00.030 --> 02:42:04.970
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So, unless that is duly verified, hindi po magpo-proceed yung oath-taking.

asr-002696
02:42:05.150 --> 02:42:13.970
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So, if the oath administrator is convinced that the one taking the oath is really the person na may-ari ng salen,

asr-002697
02:42:14.030 --> 02:42:15.770
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: that's the only time that he will allow it.

asr-002698
02:42:16.950 --> 02:42:20.610
Rep. Brian Poe: I want to understand, ano yung authentication process nyo?

asr-002699
02:42:20.610 --> 02:42:24.610
Rep. Brian Poe: Is it just mag-zoom tayo tapos i-coconvert?

asr-002700
02:42:25.010 --> 02:42:28.830
Rep. Brian Poe: Affirm na ako yung kausap mo doon sa Zoom? Ganun po ba?

asr-002701
02:42:28.930 --> 02:42:38.250
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Opo. Mag-zoom po and then the oath administrator will ask questions about the identity of the one taking the oath.

asr-002702
02:42:38.350 --> 02:42:44.810
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So that he will be personally convinced that the one taking the oath is really the owner of the salen.

asr-002703
02:42:45.310 --> 02:42:47.150
Rep. Brian Poe: I'm all for efficiency, no?

asr-002704
02:42:47.290 --> 02:42:49.950
Rep. Brian Poe: Pero nakakatakot na talaga yung AI technology.

asr-002705
02:42:49.950 --> 02:42:54.950
Rep. Brian Poe: May mga AI technology na pwede mong gamitin para mag-iiba tayo.

asr-002706
02:42:55.010 --> 02:43:01.150
Rep. Brian Poe: Kaya talaga yung itsura mo to look like someone else completely in a live feed between people.

asr-002707
02:43:01.750 --> 02:43:04.110
Rep. Brian Poe: Ang daming naloloko dito sa mga scams, etc.

asr-002708
02:43:04.590 --> 02:43:09.170
Rep. Brian Poe: Ang takot ko, baka mamaya sa oath-taking for something as important as the salen,

asr-002709
02:43:09.410 --> 02:43:11.890
Rep. Brian Poe: baka may mag-impersonate pa ng tao dito.

asr-002710
02:43:12.710 --> 02:43:19.870
Rep. Brian Poe: Ede, yari yung public official or yung government official kung mali yung salen tapos AI pala yun.

asr-002711
02:43:20.810 --> 02:43:22.590
Rep. Brian Poe: Ano yung authentication process natin?

asr-002712
02:43:22.590 --> 02:43:24.510
Rep. Brian Poe: Hindi pwede, parang zoom lang.

asr-002713
02:43:28.120 --> 02:43:42.040
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Nakalagay naman po doon, all precaution should be taken to ensure the real identities of the persons involved.

asr-002714
02:43:42.660 --> 02:43:45.620
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So, thank you po for that advice.

asr-002715
02:43:46.260 --> 02:43:49.700
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: I think all oath administrators ought to do that.

asr-002716
02:43:50.100 --> 02:43:55.640
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Kasi kung nagkataon na iba yung nag-undertake ng oath sa kanya, baka pa rin siya magkaroon ng liability.

asr-002717
02:43:56.240 --> 02:43:57.960
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And I think everyone who is given...

