asr-003001
02:57:41.520 --> 02:57:43.340
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Na-issue po yun before past. Siguro

asr-003002
02:57:43.340 --> 02:57:45.400
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: if I'm not mistaken

asr-003003
02:57:45.400 --> 02:57:47.580
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: maybe three or

asr-003004
02:57:47.580 --> 02:57:49.060
