asr-003069
03:02:02.630 --> 03:02:04.770
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong 2019 po.

asr-003070
03:02:04.850 --> 03:02:11.830
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The Land Bank of the Philippines Employees Association filed a complaint of constructive demotion to the CSC.

asr-003071
03:02:12.710 --> 03:02:27.990
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, the commission dismissed that the removal of their allowances, benefits, and incentives amounting to 100,000 pesos were pursuant to the law and is not a demotion of rank.

asr-003072
03:02:29.210 --> 03:02:33.830
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, ang problem po dito, Madam Chairperson, po pwede nating sabihin na...

asr-003073
03:02:34.850 --> 03:02:49.490
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi siya demotion, pero po para sa isang manggagawa na working class family po, yung 100,000 pesos po na annual loss, ay kasing sakit po ng demotion din.

asr-003074
03:02:50.330 --> 03:02:56.210
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, to add fuel to the fire, Madam Chairperson, the case was filed in 2019.

asr-003075
03:02:56.870 --> 03:03:03.270
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero nagkaroon lang po ng resolution or decision ng CSC, 6 years.

asr-003076
03:03:04.850 --> 03:03:06.550
