CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: May dedicated na number.

asr-003088
03:04:34.850 --> 03:04:39.310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang mga regular na session for all cases para mapabilis.

asr-003089
03:04:39.470 --> 03:04:43.950
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos nag-establish kami ng mechanism para magkakaroon ng pre-commission meeting.

asr-003090
03:04:44.110 --> 03:04:47.350
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Lahat ng abogado ng tatlong executive offices.

asr-003091
