03:04:56.870 --> 03:05:03.490
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Mas mapabilis yung pag-aaral dun sa decision na inire-recommend ng Office of Legal Affairs.

asr-003095
03:05:03.730 --> 03:05:04.630
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: When we adopted.

asr-003096
03:05:04.850 --> 03:05:10.310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos mechanism na pinaigsian yung review, pero mas matindi ang review sa Office of Legal Affairs.

asr-003097
03:05:10.750 --> 03:05:15.310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: And then we go to the executive committee meetings through a series of pre-commission meetings

asr-003098
03:05:15.310 --> 03:05:17.510
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: para mas mabilis yung action ng commission.

asr-003099
03:05:18.150 --> 03:05:20.250
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So those are the measures that we have done.

asr-003100
03:05:20.710 --> 03:05:24.730
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: If you look at our record from end 2024 up to 2026,

asr-003101
03:05:25.150 --> 03:05:31.130
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: yung dami po na na-dispose namin na cases compared to the previous years ay medyo malayo na po.

asr-003102
03:05:31.390 --> 03:05:34.070
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang target namin is within the end of the year.

asr-003103
03:05:34.070 --> 03:05:41.270
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung backlog namin sa mga kapapasok lang na mga kaso ay ma-reduce to at least 10% or 5%.

asr-003104
03:05:41.270 --> 03:05:43.970
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Maiiwan na lang pala 10% or 5%.

asr-003105
03:05:43.970 --> 03:05:46.730
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Yung sa aging cases, kailangan naming hukayin.

asr-003106
03:05:47.190 --> 03:05:52.930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero I would think, depending on the numbers, ay pwede nating hukayin.

asr-003107
03:05:53.410 --> 03:05:55.610
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Medyo dumami-dami na yun.

asr-003108
03:05:55.930 --> 03:06:00.590
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ang naging problema rin po before, hindi problema actually, but that is how processes work.

asr-003109
03:06:00.590 --> 03:06:03.690
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Parang kinopia kasi yung adjudication system.

asr-003110
03:06:04.070 --> 03:06:09.750
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: The judiciary na hindi inilalabas yung decision hanggang hindi prinopromulgate.

asr-003111
03:06:10.170 --> 03:06:18.010
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Pero ang sinasabi ko ngayon is ipagdugtungin natin yung pinag-usapan namin sa meetings namin is

asr-003112
03:06:18.010 --> 03:06:23.810
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: basta in-approve ng commission at subject na lang sa editing, pwede na namin siyang ilabas.

asr-003113
03:06:24.190 --> 03:06:27.390
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Tapos pwede namin ilagay doon yung upon effectivity.

asr-003114
03:06:27.950 --> 03:06:30.390
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: It can be a number of choices.

asr-003115
03:06:30.390 --> 03:06:31.930
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Depende sa klase ng kaso.

asr-003116
03:06:32.290 --> 03:06:34.050
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Effectivity upon approval of the commission.

asr-003117
03:06:34.070 --> 03:06:39.530
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Or after 10 to 15 days of publication in the official gazette.

asr-003118
03:06:40.170 --> 03:06:42.490
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So those are the remedial measures that we have done.

asr-003119
03:06:42.930 --> 03:06:52.130
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hopefully, if the project of ASCOM Ariel, which is the CLAS, which is the Civil Service Legal and Administrative Services Electronic System,

asr-003120
03:06:52.470 --> 03:06:54.810
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: baka mas mapabilis na po ang disposition ng cases.

asr-003121
03:06:55.150 --> 03:06:58.830
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Kasi masakit po talaga sa akin yung matagal na disposition of cases.

asr-003122
03:06:58.830 --> 03:07:01.570
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Naging maliit din po ako na empleyado ng gobyerno.

asr-003123
03:07:01.650 --> 03:07:03.670
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: I rose from the ranks, so I know how it feels.

asr-003124
03:07:04.070 --> 03:07:05.610
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: If you have these pending cases.

asr-003125
03:07:06.010 --> 03:07:09.310
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Sa disciplinary board ka nga lang po kung dalhin, masakit na eh.

asr-003126
03:07:10.450 --> 03:07:19.550
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: So we'll try very hard, sir, to make our case disposition faster.

