asr-003138
03:08:05.480 --> 03:08:07.900
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Paki check nyo lang.

asr-003139
03:08:07.980 --> 03:08:08.660
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Ibigay nyo kayo, sir.

asr-003140
03:08:10.560 --> 03:08:12.420
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Can we provide you with a figure?

asr-003141
03:08:12.740 --> 03:08:14.000
CSC Chairperson Marilyn B. Yap: Hanapin lang po sandali

asr-003142
03:08:16.620 --> 03:08:16.920
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Opo.

asr-003143
03:08:17.020 --> 03:08:30.100
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And as to how it can hasten the disposition of the case, well, unang-unang po, one of the features of the CLAS is to allow the online filing of pleadings from our public.

asr-003144
03:08:30.660 --> 03:08:36.660
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: And then from the online filing of pleadings, there will be online transmission of all the documents that we are receiving.

asr-003145
03:08:36.660 --> 03:08:47.660
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: From the receiving section to the record section of the OLA, to the divisions and the action officers handling the case, everything will be digitalized.

asr-003146
03:08:48.300 --> 03:08:51.880
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: E-scan po yun so that they will be working on documents na hindi na po physical.

asr-003147
03:08:52.540 --> 03:08:58.200
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: They will just be looking at the scan copy and then they will be working on those documents.

asr-003148
03:08:59.040 --> 03:09:06.420
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Pangalawa po, if there are records that we need, for example, from our regional offices, through the CLAS po.

asr-003149
03:09:06.420 --> 03:09:08.860
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Kasi interconnected na po lahat ng offices namin.

asr-003150
03:09:09.460 --> 03:09:12.700
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Hindi na po kami maghihintay ng matagal na panahon just to receive the records.

asr-003151
03:09:13.120 --> 03:09:22.500
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: They can transmit the records to us online so that in no time, we can receive the records that we need so that we can finally dispose of the case.

asr-003152
03:09:23.140 --> 03:09:27.380
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Naka-involve na rin po sa CLAS ang lahat ng opisina ng commission sa central office.

asr-003153
03:09:27.860 --> 03:09:34.220
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: So pati po yung transmission from OLA to our secretariat and then eventually to the executive offices.

asr-003154
03:09:34.220 --> 03:09:36.020
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Mas mabilis na po lahat yun.

asr-003155
03:09:36.420 --> 03:09:38.920
CSC Assistant Commissioner Ariel Ronquillo: Everything can be acted upon with dispatch.

asr-003156
